    title: "cma: executable compound practice loop"
    authors:
      - family-names: Lucic
        given-names: Lovro
        orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0008-9976-6933"
    license: Apache-2.0
    notes: "The canonical reference implementation that cma-mcp wraps. cma-mcp invokes its CLI as a subprocess; the data substrate (`~/.cma/*.jsonl`) is shared between cma and cma-mcp."
